License (English translation, for convenience; the French text above prevails)
==============================================================================

1. Scope. This text covers the source code, interface, texts, textures and tools of Warband
   Keeper (World of Warcraft addon, PC client and repository tools), except the third-party
   files and data listed in THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md, which keep their own licenses.

2. Allowed, free of charge: (a) downloading, installing and using Warband Keeper for your
   personal use; (b) reading the source code and modifying it for your own personal use,
   without distributing it; (c) proposing fixes or improvements to the author (for instance
   with a pull request on the original repository), which may then be included in Warband
   Keeper under this license; (d) what GitHub's terms of service allow on a public repository
   (viewing, forking within GitHub), within those terms only.

3. Not allowed without the author's written permission: (a) publishing, distributing,
   selling, renting or making available Warband Keeper or any part of its code, interface or
   textures on any site or service; (b) publishing a modified version, copy or adaptation,
   even free, partial or under another name; (c) using the name "Warband Keeper", its logo or
   a presentation suggesting a link with this project for another addon or software;
   (d) removing or altering copyright and license notices.

4. Third-party data and libraries listed in THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md are not covered by the
   restrictions above and stay under their original licenses, which prevail for those files.

5. Warband Keeper is provided "as is", without warranty of any kind.

6. For any permission, contact the author through the project's GitHub repository.
